      "id": "a2.weather.weather-in-my-town",
      "level": "A2",
      "topics": ["weather"],
      "title": "The weather in my town",
      "text": "In my town, summers are hot and sunny, and winters are cold and windy. It doesn't snow very often, but it rains a lot in the fall. Today it is cloudy, and the forecast says it is going to rain this afternoon, so I'm taking an umbrella. Tomorrow will be warmer than today.",
      "source": { "kind": "original" }
    }
  ],
